# OpenClaw Architecture

## Mandatory Pipeline
```
REQUEST → orchestor → research → cto → quant → risk → coder → ops → DEPLOYED
```
**NO CODING BEFORE RESEARCH. EVER.**

## Agent Registry
| Agent | Role | Model | Workspace |
|-------|------|-------|-----------|
| main | Light router / entrypoint | Qwen 3 8B (local) | workspace/ |
| orchestor | CEO — workflow control | Claude Sonnet 4.6 | workspace-orchestor/ |
| research | Find existing solutions | Claude 4.5 / Qwen 3.5 27B | workspace-research/ |
| cto | System architecture | Qwen 3.5 27B (local) | workspace-cto/ |
| quant | Trading strategies | DeepSeek R1 14B (local) | workspace-quant/ |
| risk | Risk validation | Qwen 3 14B (local) | workspace-risk/ |
| coder | Production code | Qwen 2.5 Coder 32B (local) | workspace-coder/ |
| coder-fast | Fast iterations | Qwen 2.5 Coder 7B (local) | workspace-coder-fast/ |
| ops | Deployment | Mistral Small 7B (local) | workspace-ops/ |

## Task Routing
- `fast_loop` → coder-fast
- `final_code` → coder
- `architecture` → cto
- `research` → research
- `strategy` → quant
- `risk_validation` → risk
- `deployment` → ops

## Cost Rules
- 90% of tasks → local Ollama (free)
- Claude → orchestration + complex reasoning only
- Escalate to Claude only when local model fails
- Reuse code > generate new code

## Config Files
- Main config: `openclaw.json`
- Environment: `.env`
- Gateway: localhost:18789
- Ollama: http://127.0.0.1:11434
